Package: cengenAnnotate
Title: Automated CeNGEN-Based Annotation of Seurat Clusters
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Marc", "Hammarlund", , "marc.hammarlund@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Automates annotation of C. elegans single-cell RNA-seq
    clusters by scoring Seurat cluster marker genes against CeNGEN
    reference expression data. Computes a dot-plot-equivalent coherence
    score for each candidate neuron type from unthresholded expression
    and percent-expressing values, and classifies clusters as
    confidently annotatable or in need of manual review, replacing the
    manual workflow of pasting marker genes into the CeNGEN website and
    visually reading the resulting dot plot. Reference datasets are
    discovered and fetched at runtime from a 'pins' board so new CeNGEN
    dataset releases (developmental stage and sex variants) become
    available without package changes.
